<title>UK: UK May up final s/a 11.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>UK May up final s/a 11.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following data on UK monetary aggregates for April -</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY			MAY     PVS REPORTED</p>
<p>    M4 in month	 (adjusted)  1.4	    1.3</p>
<p>	 in year to date(adjusted)  11.1	  11.1</p>
<p>    M4 in month     (unadjusted)   1.9	   1.9</p>
<p>    in year to date (unadjusted)  11.0	  11.0</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>    societies in billions of stg   9.1	   9.2</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
</text>
